

                                 INTRODUCTION 
                                --------------
 Hello and welcome all AMIGA owners.  On this disk is a game, which I have 
 called "OH NO ITS NEIL."  My name is Sean Kelly and I am the creater of
 this game.  I have spent the past year and a half making this game.  I hope
 that you will enjoy playing "OH NO ITS NEIL," as it is my first game and
 I have tried to make it as impressive as possible.  If you have gone to
 the trouble of of playing this game, then please let me know your views.

                               THE STORY SO FAR
                              ------------------
 Neil's family have been captured by the evil GRALDA'S stormtroopers, while
 Neil was hanging around with his mates.  When Neil returns home he find
 no sign of his family, so he turn up the SterioSystem to the highest.
 Meanwhile, the stormtroopers hear the music and find Neil working on his
 dancing technique.  Neil is captured and inprisoned in an old tower.  It
 is then he realises that he and the rest of his family are in deep trouble.

                               PLAYING THE GAME
                              ------------------
 
 This is a REALITY game and works like those DIZZY games from years ago.
 FIRE is used to talk to someone, pick up objects and to sometimes look
 at objects.  Left and right are used to go left and right, up is used to
 jump.  In order for an object to appear, FIRE must be pressed e.g. when
 talking to the drunken man in the pub.
 In the game, you will notice stars scattered around the landscape and in
 buildings.  These stars have noting to do with completing the game,
 but are a good way of seeing if you have been in all the locations.  There
 is a total of 30 stars.

                            
